#: ../../source/4-reference/controllers/6-gripper_teleop_plugins.md:13
#: f205ad37107d4775a2ece3b90877544f
msgid ""
"The launch stack does **not** take `gripper:=`. Attach an end-effector "
"with `type` / `left_type` / `right_type` (and optional `robot_profile` / "
"`use_profile_eef`) from "
"[robot_common_launch](../descriptions/2-common.md). Hands and grippers "
"that this controller can load are spawned from those EEF keys, not a "
"separate `gripper` argument."
msgstr ""
"launch 栈**没有** `gripper:=`。用 [robot_common_launch](../descriptions/2-common.md) 的 `type` / `left_type` / `right_type`（以及可选的 `robot_profile` / `use_profile_eef`）挂载末端。本控制器能加载的手/夹爪由这些末端键拉起，而不是单独的 `gripper` 参数。"

